        {
          "id": "eb7f7dde-09c9-40ae-ac5d-8e026e367f91",
          "name": "List AHJs",
          "request": {
            "name": "List AHJs",
            "description": {
              "content": "Retrieve a paginated list of Authorities Having Jurisdiction (AHJs).\n\nSupports:\n- Pagination (`page_size`, `page`)\n- Sorting by name (`order_by`, default: asc)\n- Search by name or state code (`q`) — when `q` is exactly two characters it also matches the two-letter state code\n- Filter by `state` (two-letter code), `type`, and `country` (default: `US`)\n- Geo mode: pass `lat`+`lng` (together) to return every AHJ whose boundary covers the point — e.g. city, county, and state — ordered most-specific-first. Name/state/type filters are ignored, and an empty array is returned if none cover the point.\n\nOnly active jurisdictions are returned. AHJs are seeded globally from the US Census TIGER catalog plus per-company private records. Most fields are read-only; only custom fields can be updated (see PATCH /ahjs/{id}).\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "ahjs"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Number of items per page (max 100)"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Page number (1-based)"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "q",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Search by AHJ name (case-insensitive). If exactly two characters, also matches the state code."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "state",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter by two-letter state code (e.g. \"CA\")."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "type",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter by jurisdiction type."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "country",
                  "value": "US",
                  "description": "Filter by country code."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "order_by",
                  "value": "asc",
                  "description": "Sort order for results"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "lat",
                  "value": "<double>",
                  "description": "Latitude in decimal degrees. Must be used together with `lng`."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "lng",
                  "value": "<double>",
                  "description": "Longitude in decimal degrees. Must be used together with `lat`."
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
